## Project guides

These guides are project conventions. Read only the guide relevant to the task; do not load every guide for routine, focused edits.

- Read `ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/architecture/overview.md` before changing a boundary, public interface, data flow, deployment shape, or cross-cutting concern.
- Read `TEAM_GUIDE.md` when work affects ownership, handoffs, or coordination across contributors.
- Follow `PLANS.md` for a multi-step, risky, or cross-cutting change. Keep a durable plan in `docs/plans/` when that guide requires one.
- Apply `CODE_REVIEW.md` when reviewing code or preparing a change for review. If GitHub is used, complete `.github/pull_request_template.md` as applicable.

